          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your scales are especially colorful, possessing some of the same resistance a dragon possesses. You gain resistance equal to half your level (minimum 1) to the damage type associated with your draconic exemplar. Double this resistance against dragons' Breath Weapons."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
